    "enUS": {
      "description": "Take this Nether Gem to my old comrade Bethor.  It will let us communicate ... and I have much to tell him.",
      "dialogue": {
        "58f1f01548fe5696ba28": "You convinced him to join us!  You have done a great deed for the Forsaken, $N.  The Dark Lady will be informed.",
        "95d9f6430c388fe98675": "Take this Nether Gem to my old comrade Bethor.  It will let us communicate ... and I have much to tell him.",
        "97a427353eccbfad8c30": "Have you returned Gunther's book?  Has he responded?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Nether Gem to Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity.",
      "title": "The Prodigal Lich Returns",
